Task 4: Point-in-Time Recovery & Clone Instance
Run this block in Cloud Shell to turn on Point-in-Time Recovery and create the required clone instance:

Bash
# Enable Point-in-Time Recovery and binary logging
gcloud sql instances patch $CLOUD_SQL_INSTANCE \
    --enable-point-in-time-recovery \
    --enable-bin-log

# Create the PITR clone instance
gcloud sql instances clone $CLOUD_SQL_INSTANCE${CLOUD_SQL_INSTANCE}-pitr
